{
  "title": "Ramp: outbound GTM system, end to end",
  "subtitle": "Drawn from context/docs/gtm-system.md (design v1, 2026-11-14). US Mid-Market, segments S1 software, S2 construction, S3 healthcare. Row 1 reads left to right, row 2 right to left, row 3 left to right.",
